## Typography

### Font pairing

| Element | Font | Size | Weight |
|---|---|---|---|
| Slide title / headline | Palatino (or Georgia) | 36–40pt | Regular (not bold) — elegance over aggression |
| Section label | Calibri | 11pt | Regular, uppercase, tracked (letter-spacing: 2pt) |
| Body text | Calibri | 14–16pt | Regular |
| Stat callout (big number) | Palatino | 52–64pt | Regular |
| Caption / footnote | Calibri | 10pt | Regular, warm gray |
| CTA text | Calibri | 16pt | Bold |

### Typography rules

- Headline = message, not topic. It should be a complete thought.
- Headlines are sentence case, not title case: "Why co-working beats leasing" not "Why Co-Working Beats Leasing"
- Never center body text — left-align all paragraphs and bullets
- Center only: slide titles on hook/cover slides, large stat callouts, CTA text
- Max 2 font sizes per slide (title + body, or stat + caption)
- No bold in body text — use a new slide instead of bolding for emphasis

---

## Layout patterns

### Slide structure

All slides share the same grid:
- Left margin: 0.6"
- Right margin: 0.6"
- Top margin: 0.5" (title zone)
- Bottom margin: 0.4" (footer zone)
- Content area: between title and footer

**Footer** (every slide except hook/cover):
- Slide number: bottom right, 10pt warm gray
- Deck name or logo: bottom left, 10pt warm gray (optional)
- Thin warm gray line above footer: `#D6D1C8`, 0.5pt

### Layout options by slide type

**Full-bleed text (hook/cover)**
- Background: accent color OR warm cream `#F2EFE9`
- One large headline centered, Palatino 44pt
- Subtitle below in Calibri 16pt warm gray
- No other elements

**Two-column (text left, visual right)**
- Left 55%: headline + body text or bullets
- Right 45%: chart, image placeholder, or large stat
- 0.3" gap between columns

**Stat callout (data slide)**
- Large number centered or left-aligned: 60pt Palatino, accent color
- Label below: 12pt Calibri warm gray
- Supporting text below: 14pt Calibri warm charcoal
- Optional: thin accent-colored left border on the stat block (2pt, accent color)

**Icon + text rows**
- 3–4 rows, each: small icon placeholder (24×24pt warm gray square) + bold label + one-line description
- Consistent vertical spacing: 0.4" between rows

**Section divider**
- Warm cream background `#F2EFE9`
- Section number: 11pt Calibri, uppercase, warm gray, tracked
- Section title: 32pt Palatino, warm charcoal, left-aligned
- Optional: thin horizontal accent line above title (1pt, accent color, left-aligned, 1" wide)

