## Cohesion rules (enforce across all slides)

1. **Background is always `#FAFAF8`** — never change it mid-deck (except hook slide)
2. **One accent color, used max 3–4 times total** across the whole deck
3. **All headlines use Palatino** — no mixing with Calibri for headlines
4. **Consistent footer** on every content slide
5. **Consistent margin grid** — nothing breaks out of the 0.6" margins
6. **Card/surface color is always `#F2EFE9`** — don't introduce new background colors for content blocks
7. **No slide-specific color themes** — a "data slide" doesn't get a different palette than a "text slide"
8. **Icons and shapes**: warm gray `#7A7874` only, never colored icons unless using the accent

