## Accent usage budget (per deck)

| Element | Accent allowed? |
|---|---|
| Hook slide background | Yes (optional) |
| Most important stat number | Yes — one slide only |
| CTA / close slide text | Yes |
| Section divider line | Yes — max one per section |
| Body text | Never |
| Headline text | Never |
| Icons | Never |
| Borders/dividers (general) | Never — use `#D6D1C8` |
| Chart fill (primary bar/line) | Yes — one series only |

Total accent uses per deck: **4–6 maximum**. If you're using it more, pull back.
